## 🔮 Prediction Example  
```python
def predict_tweet(text):
    seq = tokenizer.texts_to_sequences([clean(text)])
    padded = pad_sequences(seq, maxlen=100)
    pred = model.predict(padded).argmax(axis=1)[0]
    labels = {0:"Hate Speech", 1:"Offensive", 2:"Neither"}
    return labels[pred]

print(predict_tweet("I hate all of you"))
# Output: Hate Speech
```

